# B310 flags urllib.request.urlopen even where the surrounding service contract
# restricts the target to bounded HTTP(S) integrations. The project security
# regression suite covers those URL construction paths.
#
# B103 flags the deliberately group-shared Unix socket and setgid runtime
# directories (0660 / 02770). Those modes are part of the NAS privilege model:
# owner/group access is required and access for "other" remains disabled.
# Keep every other medium/high Bandit rule enabled.
skips:
  - B103
  - B310
